WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.295 --> 00:00:13.115
flew into the air.

2
00:00:14.376 --> 00:00:15.417
Now she had a plan.

3
00:00:15.437 --> 00:00:18.739
"I'll follow that armored truck," she thought.

4
00:00:18.759 --> 00:00:21.762
"Stinky Bart will definitely try to rob it."

5
00:00:22.842 --> 00:00:24.363
Roxy followed the armored truck.

6
00:00:25.944 --> 00:00:27.385
The truck turned off West Street.

7
00:00:29.507 --> 00:00:30.828
It stopped at a grocery store.

8
00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:34.901
The guards put some money into the truck.

9
00:00:38.084 --> 00:00:39.305
The truck drove some more.

10
00:00:41.467 --> 00:00:43.589
It stopped at two more stores and one bank.

11
00:00:45.911 --> 00:00:47.672
Then it got stuck in a traffic jam.

12
00:00:51.875 --> 00:00:54.598
After two more turns, the truck was back on West Street.

13
00:00:56.119 --> 00:00:58.081
Roxy didn't see Stinky Bart anywhere.

14
00:00:59.342 --> 00:01:00.142
Roxy sighed.

15
00:01:00.162 --> 00:01:01.984
"This was a dumb idea.

16
00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:05.441
I should—" "Yee-ha!"

17
00:01:05.721 --> 00:01:06.482
shouted a voice.

18
00:01:06.502 --> 00:01:08.723
"Stinky Bart!"

19
00:01:09.003 --> 00:01:09.703
thought Roxy.

20
00:01:10.664 --> 00:01:13.085
A man on a horse was chasing the armored truck.

21
00:01:14.225 --> 00:01:16.726
He wore cowboy boots and a floppy cowboy hat.

22
00:01:17.847 --> 00:01:19.728
He was swinging a lasso over his head.

23
00:01:19.748 --> 00:01:22.269
"I want that money!"

24
00:01:22.589 --> 00:01:23.749
shouted Stinky Bart.

25
00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:26.431
He threw the lasso toward the armored truck.

26
00:01:26.451 --> 00:01:29.172
"Uh-oh!" cried Roxy.

27
00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:31.622
She fired her eye laser beams.

28
00:01:32.002 --> 00:01:33.843
Whiz-hoo! Ping!

29
00:01:34.844 --> 00:01:36.726
The laser beams bounced off the lasso.

30
00:01:37.386 --> 00:01:38.687
The lasso missed the truck.

31
00:01:38.707 --> 00:01:41.289
"Wow," said Roxy.

32
00:01:41.309 --> 00:01:45.032
"My eye laser beams didn't harm that lasso at all!

33
00:01:46.834 --> 00:01:48.435
But at least I saved the truck."

34
00:01:49.616 --> 00:01:52.278
Stinky Bart jumped off the horse and glared at Roxy.

35
00:01:52.298 --> 00:01:57.042
"That sure made me angry, Rocket Girl," said the cowboy.

36
00:01:57.963 --> 00:01:59.484
He started swinging the lasso.

37
00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:03.561
"Yep! I'm mighty angry right now!"

38
00:02:04.881 --> 00:02:08.102
Shwoosh! The lasso sailed toward Roxy.

39
00:02:09.242 --> 00:02:10.383
She darted out of the way.

40
00:02:10.403 --> 00:02:12.023
"Missed me!"

41
00:02:12.863 --> 00:02:13.644
Roxy laughed.

42
00:02:13.664 --> 00:02:15.724
"Hoo, boy!"

43
00:02:16.024 --> 00:02:16.924
said Stinky Bart.

44
00:02:16.944 --> 00:02:20.025
"I am furious!"

45
00:02:21.306 --> 00:02:22.626
He threw the lasso again.

46
00:02:23.686 --> 00:02:26.107
Roxy laughed as she moved out of the way again.

47
00:02:26.127 --> 00:02:29.608
"You'll never catch me, Stinky Bart!"

48
00:02:30.736 --> 00:02:32.798
Stinky Bart stopped swinging the lasso.

49
00:02:32.818 --> 00:02:35.200
"Maybe not," he said.

50
00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:38.243
"But maybe I don't need to."

51
00:02:39.264 --> 00:02:40.485
The cowboy looked around.

52
00:02:41.886 --> 00:02:44.188
A crowd of people stood near the big bear statue.

53
00:02:45.209 --> 00:02:47.090
They were buying pretzels at a pretzel stand.

54
00:02:48.912 --> 00:02:50.533
Stinky Bart tossed the lasso.

55
00:02:50.553 --> 00:02:55.738
"Yee-ha!" The lasso looped around the bear statue's head.

56
00:02:56.779 --> 00:02:57.840
Stinky Bart pulled.

57
00:02:58.944 --> 00:03:00.985
The bear began to fall toward the crowd.

58
00:03:02.145 --> 00:03:03.106
Everyone screamed.

59
00:03:03.126 --> 00:03:05.347
"Save us, Rocket Girl!"

60
00:03:05.527 --> 00:03:06.547
cried the pretzel man.

61
00:03:07.548 --> 00:03:08.708
Roxy flew fast.

62
00:03:10.429 --> 00:03:13.010
She caught the bear statue just before it hit the crowd.

63
00:03:14.771 --> 00:03:16.611
She didn't notice the lasso slip off.

64
00:03:18.552 --> 00:03:21.153
Everyone cheered as Roxy stood the statue back up.

65
00:03:21.173 --> 00:03:22.834
"Thank you!"

66
00:03:23.094 --> 00:03:23.974
said the pretzel man.

67
00:03:26.456 --> 00:03:27.376
Roxy smiled.

68
00:03:28.104 --> 00:03:29.326
"No problem, folks.

69
00:03:29.787 --> 00:03:33.752
I—aah!" Roxy felt the lasso loop around her.

70
00:03:33.772 --> 00:03:37.016
"Yee-ha!" cried Stinky Bart.
